## 7. (Optional, lower priority) Self-host the font

`app/layout.tsx` uses `next/font/google` for Inter, which fetches from `fonts.googleapis.com` at build time. This works fine with normal internet access, but the original build spec's intent was explicitly to self-host: *"Inter self-hosted as the actual web font."* If you have the font files available or can generate them (`next font` local setup, `.woff2` files under `/public/fonts` or similar), switch to `next/font/local` so builds don't depend on Google's servers being reachable — useful for CI environments or offline builds. If this is friction, skip it — it's the lowest-priority item in this phase and not worth blocking on.

